div.p:
prakaraṇamupasaṃharati- itītyādi| iti samāptau;
                               tenaitāvadeva sāmānyādiṣaṭkaṃ sarvasyaiva kāryajātasya kāraṇaṃ,
                               nānyat kāraṇamasti|53|-

div.quote:
tat punastrividhaṃ proktaṃ
                                    jaṅgamaudbhidapārthivam ‘jāṅgamaṃ bhaumamaudbhidam’ iti
                                    pā.;

div.p:
mahāsneheṣu sarpirādau paṭhitaṃ, prādhānyāt;
                               vacanaṃ hi- “nānyaḥ snehastathā kaścit saṃskāramanuvartate| yathā
                               sarpirataḥ sarpiḥ sarvasnehottamaṃ matam” (ni.a.1) iti||86-87||-

div.quote:
uṣṇaṃ tīkṣṇamatho+arūkṣaṃ ‘arūkṣaṃ snigdhaṃ’ iti
                                    gaṅgādharaḥ; yogīndranāthastu ‘rūkṣaṃ’ iti paṭhati; 
                                kaṭukaṃ lavaṇānvitam

pavitraṃ vṛṣyamāyuṣyaṃ
                                    śramasvedamalāpaham‘kāmyaṃ puṣṭibalapradam;
                                    saumanasyamalakṣmīghnaṃ snānamojaskaraṃ param’;; iti
                                pā.;

nāmudgayūṣaṃ nākṣaudraṃ noṣṇaṃ
                                    nāmalakairvināasyāgre- “alakṣmīdoṣayuktatvānnaktaṃ tu
                                    dadhi varjitam; śleṣmalaṃ syāt sasarpiṣkaṃ dadhi mārutasūdanam;;
                                    na ca sandhukṣayet pittamāhāraṃ ca vipācayet; śarkarāsaṃyutaṃ
                                    dadyāttṛṣṇādāhanivāraṇam;; mudgasūpena saṃyuktaṃ
                                    dadyādraktānilāpaham; surasaṃ cālpadoṣaṃ ca kṣaudrayuktaṃ
                                    bhaveddadhi; uṣṇaṃ pittāsrakṛddoṣān dhātrīyuktaṃ tu nirharet”;;
                                    iti kvacidadhikaḥ pāṭha upalabhyate;

yataśca pratikurvan sidhyati, pratikurvan mriyate;
                                apratikurvan sidhyati, apratikurvan mriyate; tataścintyate
                                    bheṣajamabheṣajenāviśiṣṭamiti ‘iti maitreyaḥ’ iti pā.;

ata evānumīyate- yat- svakṛtamaparihāryamavināśi
                                paurvadehikaṃ daivasañjñakamānubandhikaṃ karma, tasyaitat phalam;
                                itaścānyadbhaviṣyatīti; phaladbījamanumīyate, phalaṃ ca bījāt

ityasātmyendriyārthasaṃyogaḥ, prajñāparādhaḥ,
                                pariṇāmaśceti trayastrividhavikalpā hetavo vikārāṇāṃ;
                                samayogayuktāstu prakṛtihetavo bhavanti

uṣṇodakopacārī syādbrahmacārī kṣapāśayaḥ
                                    ‘brahmacārī kṣapāśaya ityanena
                                    maithunadivāsvapnarātrijāgaraṇānāṃ niṣedhaḥ’ iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

div.p:
piṇḍairyathoktairiti tilamāṣādipiṇḍaistathā
                               gokharādigranthoktapuṭakarūpaiśca piṇḍaiḥ;
                               svedanamevopasvedanam||41||

div.quote:
nistudyete bhṛśaṃ śaṅkau ghāṭā 'ghāṭā
                                    grīvāyāḥ paścādbhāgaḥ, 'ghāḍa’ iti yasyāpabhraṃśaḥ’; 
                                sambhidyate tathā

rundhyāttadā prakurvīta śītakaṃ gauravaṃ rujam
                                    'prakṛtisthaṃ yadā vātaṃ śleṣmā pittaparikṣaye;
                                    sannirundhyāttadā kuryācchītakaṃ gauravaṃ jvaram' iti pā.;

kurvīta sannirundhāno mṛdvagnitvaṃ śirograham
                                    'prakṛtisthaṃ yadā pittaṃ śleṣmā mārutasaṅkṣaye;
                                    sannirundhyāttadā kuryānmṛdvagnitvaṃ śirograham' iti pā.;

ghaṭṭate sahate śabdaṃ noccairdravati
                                    'dravati iti hṛdayaṃ dhugadhugiti karoti' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;
                                 śūlyate

yasya śastrakuśacchinnācchoṇitaṃ
                                    'chinnādityanantaraṃ 'aṅgāt' iti śeṣaḥ' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;
                                    'śastrakuśacchedāt' iti pā.;  na pravartate

ayathopacayotsāho 'ayathopacayotsāha iti
                                    śarīropacayānurūpabalarahita ityarthaḥ' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;
                                 naro+atisthūla ucyate

yattadātve samarthaṃ syādabhyāse vā
                                    tadiṣyate'santarpaṇasya dvaividhyamāha- yattadātva ityādi;
                                    tadātve iti sadyaḥ, samarthamiti
                                    apatarpaṇajavyādhinirākaraṇasamarthaṃ; tena sadyaḥ
                                    santarpaṇamekam, abhyāsavaśāt santarpaṇamaparamityarthaḥ' iti
                                    śivadāsasenaḥ;

paśyaṃstamaḥ praviśati śīghraṃ ca pratibudhyate
                                    'tamaḥ praviśati mūrcchatītyarthaḥ, śīghraṃ ca pratibudhyata iti
                                    vāyoḥ śīghrakāritvāt' iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

tatra dravyāṇi
                                gurukharakaṭhinamandasthiraviśadasāndrasthūlagandhaguṇabahulāni
                                    pārthivāni 'pārthivānīti pṛthivībhūtabahulānītyarthaḥ;
                                    evamāpyānītyādyapi bodhyam' iti śivadāsasenaḥ; ,
                                tānyupacayasaṅghātagauravasthairyakarāṇi;
                                dravasnigdhaśītamandamṛdupicchilarasaguṇabahulānyāpyāni,
                                tānyupakledasnehabandhaviṣyandamārdavaprahlādakarāṇi;
                                uṣṇatīkṣṇasūkṣmalaghurūkṣaviśadarūpaguṇabahulānyāgneyāni, tāni
                                dāhapākaprabhāprakāśavarṇakarāṇi;
                                laghuśītarūkṣakharaviśadasūkṣmasparśaguṇabahulāni vāyavyāni, tāni
                                raukṣyaglānivicāravaiśadyalāghavakarāṇi;
                                mṛdulaghusūkṣmaślakṣṇaśabdaguṇabahulānyākāśātmakāni, tāni
                                mārdavasauṣiryalāghavakarāṇi

atha śūkadhānyavargaḥ- raktaśālirmahāśāliḥ kalamaḥ
                                    śakunāhṛtaḥ 'śakunā+a+ahṛtaḥ uttarakurubhyo haṃsairānītaḥ,
                                    avantyāṃ vakranāmnā prasiddhaḥ, magadhadeśe tu pāśaka iti;
                                    vṛddhavaidyāstu- “dvīpāntarāt samānīto garuḍena mahātmanā;
                                    śakunā+a+ahṛtaḥ sa śāliḥ syādgaruḍāparanāmakaḥ” ityāhuḥ' iti
                                    suśrutaṭīkāyāṃ ḍallaṇaḥ; aruṇadattastu aṣṭāṅgahṛdayaṭīkāyāṃ
                                    “śakunāhṛto yo magadheṣu buddhotpādakāle uttarakurubhyo
                                    haṃsairānīto mṛgārimātrā viśākhākhyayā vāpito vistāraṃ gataḥ,
                                    ata eva śakunāhṛta ityanvarthā+asya sañjñā” ityāha;

ālukāni ca sarvāṇi sapatrāṇi kuṭiñjaram
                                    ‘kuṭiñjaraṃ tāmramūlakam’ iti aruṇadattaḥ; ‘kaṭhiñjaraṃ’ iti
                                    pā.;

durjaraṃ vātaśamanaṃ nāgaraṅgaphalaṃ guru ‘sugandhi
                                    madhuraṃ sāmlaṃ viśadaṃ bhaktarocanam; guru vātapraśamanaṃ
                                    vidyānnāriṅgajaṃ phalam’ iti pā.;

śleṣmalo mārutaghnaśca palāṇḍurna ca
                                    pittanut ‘naca pittanuditi nātipittalaḥ, kiñcitpittaṃ
                                    karotyeva,’ iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

guravastarpaṇā vṛṣyāḥ kṣīrekṣurasapūpakāḥ
                                    ‘kṣīrekṣurasapūpakā iti kṣīre ikṣurase ca bhāvitāḥ pūpakā
                                    ityarthaḥ’ iti śivadāsasenaḥ;

div.p:
saukṣmyādityādinā sauvarcalaguṇaḥ|
                               taikṣṇyādityādinā biḍaguṇaḥ| audbhidam utkārikālavaṇam ‘viḍaṃ
                                   kṛtrimaṃ svanāmakhyātam;
                                   uttaradeśabhavamutkārikālavaṇamaudbhidam’ iti śivadāsasenaḥ;
                               | kālalavaṇaṃ sauvarcalamevāgandham| dakṣiṇasamudrasamīpe
                               bhavatīti sāmudraṃ karakacam| pāṃśujaṃ pūrvasamudrajam||296-304||

div.quote:
tatrāhāraprasādākhyo ‘tatrāhāraḥ prasādākhyaṃ
                                    rasaṃ kiṭṭaṃ ca malākhyamabhinirvartayati’ iti pā.; 
                                rasaḥ kiṭṭaṃ ca malākhyamabhinirvartate

saṃvartamānaṃ‘saṃvardhamānaṃ’ iti pā. hṛdayaṃ
                                samāviśati yat purā ‘samāviśati yat punaḥ’ iti
                                    kavirājaśrīgaṇanāthasenasammataḥ pāṭhaḥ, yuktaścāyaṃ;
                                    bhela(ḍe)+api paṭhyate- “hṛdo raso niḥsarati tata eva ca
                                    sarvataḥ; sirābhirhṛdayaṃ caiti tasmāddhṛtprabhavāḥ sirāḥ” (bhe.
                                    sū. 20) iti;

tatrāhiṃsā prāṇināṃ prāṇavardhanānāmutkṛṣṭatamaṃ, vīryaṃ
                                balavardhanānāṃ, vidyā bṛṃhaṇānām, indriyajayo nandanānāṃ,
                                tattvāvabodho harṣaṇānāṃ, brahmacaryamayanānāmiti ‘vīryam
                                    utsāhaḥ; vidyā yogavidyā; nandanānāmiti śreyaḥsamṛddhijananānām;
                                    ayanānāmiti mokṣasādhanamārgāṇām’ iti śivadāsasenaḥ; ;
                                evamāyurvedavido manyante

buddhyā samyaganupraviśyārthatattvaṃ
                                    vāgbhirvyāsasamāsapratijñāhetūdāharaṇopanayanigamanayuktābhistrividhaśiṣyabuddhigamyābhirucyamānaṃ
                                    ‘sādhyadharmavattvena pakṣakathanaṃ pratijñā, yathā- āyurvedo
                                    nitya iti; hetuḥ tatsādhakavacanaṃ, yathā- anāditvāditi;
                                    udāharaṇaṃ dṛṣṭāntaḥ, yathā- ātmavaditi; upanayo nāma
                                    sādhanadharmavattvena punaḥ pakṣakathanaṃ, yathā ātmā
                                    anādistathā cāyamiti; nigamanaṃ tu punarhetusādhitasya sādhyasya
                                    pakṣaniṣṭhatayā kathanaṃ, yathā- tasmānnityaḥ’ iti
                                    śivadāsasenaḥ; 
                                 ‘...puruṣabuddhigamyābhiḥ’ iti pā.;
                                    ‘trividhaśiṣyabuddhigamyābhiriti
                                    uttamamadhyamādhamaśiṣyabuddhigamyābhiḥ’ iti śivadāsasenaḥ;
                                vākyārthaśo bhavatyuktam

taṃ brūyāt sarvataḥ sarvaṃ yathāsvaṃ
                                    ‘yathārthāddhyanusaṅgrahāt’ iti pā.; 
                                hyarthasaṅgrahāt

te daśa pramehāḥ sādhyāḥ;
                                samānaguṇamedaḥsthānakatvāt, kaphasya prādhānyāt,
                                samakriyatvācca

teṣāmapi pūrvavadguṇaviśeṣeṇa nāmaviśeṣā bhavanti;
                                tadyathā- vasāmehaśca, majjamehaśca, hastimehaśca,
                                madhumehaśceti

div.p:
atyātmaśabdo balādibhiḥ
                               pratyekamabhisambadhyate| ātmānamatiricyeti atyātma;
                               tenātmānanurūpabalādiyogo bhavatītyarthaḥ||13||

catvāra iti
                               vacanamāgantusambandhe+apyapasmārāṇāṃ catuṣkapratipādanārtham;
                               apasmāro hi nonmādavat svatantreṇāgantunā kriyate||3||

div.quote:
madhu ca śleṣmāṇaṃ jayati, raukṣyāttaikṣṇyāt kaṣāyatvācca;
                                śleṣmā hi snigdho mando madhuraśca‘madhuraśceti viparītaguṇaḥ’
                                    iti pā.

prāgeva ca jalpājjalpāntaraṃ ‘jalpāntaraṃ jalpakasya
                                    vaiśeṣyaṃ guṇadoṣau’ iti yogīndranāthasenaḥ; 
                                parāvarāntaraṃ pariṣadviśeṣāṃśca samyak parīkṣeta

div.p:
vādamaryādālakṣaṇamāha- tatredamityādi|
                               vādaśabdena ceha vigṛhya pakṣapratipakṣavacanamātramucyate;
                               sandhāyasambhāṣayā tu tattvabubhutsorvāda uktaḥ||26||

div.quote:
yathā- ekasya pakṣaḥ punarbhavo+astīti, nāstītyaparasya;
                                tau ca svasvapakṣahetubhiḥ svasvapakṣaṃ sthāpayataḥ,
                                parapakṣamudbhāvayataḥ, eṣa jalpaḥ

yathā- anityaḥ puruṣa iti
                                    pratijñā‘viparītārthapratijñā’ iti pā.; hetuḥ-
                                aindriyakatvāditi; dṛṣṭāntaḥ- yathā ghaṭa ‘ghaṭa aindriyakaḥ,
                                    sa cānityaḥ; upanayo yathā ghaṭastathā puruṣaḥ’ iti pā.; 
                                iti, upanayo- yathā ghaṭa aindriyakaḥ sa cānityaḥ, tathā cāyamiti;
                                nigamanaṃ- tasmādanitya iti

atha hetuḥ- heturnāmopalabdhikāraṇaṃ; tat
                                pratyakṣam, anumānam, aitihyam, aupamyamiti;
                                ebhirhetubhiryadupalabhyate tat tattvam

athānumānam- anumānaṃ nāma tarko yuktyapekṣaḥ;
                                yathā- agniṃ jaraṇaśaktyā, balaṃ vyāyāmaśaktyā, śrotrādīni
                                śabdādigrahaṇenetyevamādi

div.p:
abhinirvṛttimabhisandhāyeti
                                   kartavyatābuddhiṃ ‘kartavyatāṃ buddhisthīkṛtya’ iti pā.;
                                sthirīkṛtya||72||

div.quote:
ādirnāstyātmanaḥ ‘anādirātmā kṣetrasya
                                    pāramparyamanādikam’ iti pā.; 
                                kṣetrapāramparyamanādikam

eko+adhiko nyūnataro dvitīya evaṃ
                                    ‘yame+adhike+apyeṣa bhavedviśeṣaḥ’ iti pā.; 
                                yame+apyabhyadhiko viśeṣaḥ

śukrāśayadvāravighaṭṭanena saṃskāravāhaṃ
                                    ‘saṃskāravāhaṃ hi karoti vāyuḥ’ iti pā.; 
                                kurute+anilaśca

dvitīye māsi ghanaḥ sampadyate piṇḍaḥ
                                    ‘piṇḍaḥ’ iti hastalikhitapustake na paṭhyate; 
                                peśyarbudaṃ vā

ṣaḍdhātavaḥ samuditāḥ ‘puruṣa’ iti śabdaṃ labhante;
                                tadyathā- pṛthivyāpastejo vāyurākāśaṃ brahma cāvyaktamiti, eta eva
                                ca ṣaḍdhātavaḥ samuditāḥ ‘puruṣa’ iti śabdaṃ labhante

tatra śarīraṃ nāma cetanādhiṣṭhānabhūtaṃ
                                pañcamahābhūtavikārasamudāyātmakaṃ samayogavāhi
                                    ‘samayogavāhino yadā hyasmin’ iti pā.;

pariṇamatastvāhārasya‘pariṇāmataḥ’ iti
                                    pā. guṇāḥ śarīraguṇabhāvamāpadyante yathāsvamaviruddhāḥ;
                                viruddhāśca vihanyurvihatāśca virodhibhiḥ śarīram

tayoḥ karmaṇā vedoktena vivartanamupadiśyate
                                    ‘vivartanam anyathātvena pravartanam’ iti gaṅgādharaḥ; 
                                prāgvyaktībhāvāt prayuktena samyak

aṣṭame tu māse kṣīrayavāgūṃ sarpiṣmatīṃ kāle kāle pibet;
                                tanneti bhadrakāpyaḥ, paiṅgalyābādho hyasyā garbhamāgacchediti;
                                astvatra paiṅgalyābādha ityāha bhagavān punarvasurātreyaḥ, na
                                tvevaitanna kāryam; evaṃ kurvatī
                                hyarogā+a+arogyabalavarṇasvarasaṃhananasampadupetaṃ jñātīnāmapi
                                śreṣṭhamapatyaṃ janayati

tasyāstu khalu yo vyādhirutpadyate sa kṛcchrasādhyo
                                bhavatyasādhyo vā, garbhavṛddhikṣayitaśithilasarvadhātutvāt,
                                pravāhaṇavedanākledanaraktaniḥsrutiviśeṣaśūnyaśarīratvācca;
                                tasmāttāṃ yathoktena vidhinopacaret;
                                bhautikajīvanīyabṛṃhaṇīyamadhuravātaharasiddhairabhyaṅgotsādanapariṣekāvagāhanānnapānavidhibhirviśeṣataścopacaret;
                                viśeṣato hi śūnyaśarīrāḥ striyaḥ prajātā bhavanti

urasaśca viśuṣkatvādyo naro na sa jīvati ‘peyaṃ
                                    pātuṃ na śaknoti śuṣkatvādāsyakaṇṭhayoḥ; urasaśca vivaddhatvādyo
                                    naro na sa jīvati’ iti pāṭhaḥ;

div.p:
pādānusaṅgrahe saptatriṃśatprayogā uktāḥ;
                                   tatra balādibhiraṣṭābhiḥ punarnavāntaiśca
                                   daśabhiraṣṭādaśaprayogāḥ, apare tu vyāhṛtā vyaktā eva||23||

div.quote:
nirdiṣṭāḥ prāṇakāmīye
                                        saptatriṃśanmaharṣiṇā‘sapta caivaṃ daśarṣiṇā’ iti
                                        pā.;

dhīmān yaśasvī vāksiddhaḥ‘vāgmī ca’ iti
                                        pā.; śrutadhārī mahādhanaḥ‘mahābalaḥ’ iti
                                        pā.;

kramavṛddhyā daśāhāni
                                        daśapaippalikaṃ‘daśapippalīkaṃ’ iti pā.;
                                    dinam

prakṣiptoddhṛtamapyenat‘śilājatu koṣṇe
                                        vātaharādikvāthe prakṣipya athainaṃ raudre śoṣayet;
                                        pītatatkvāthamuddhṛtaṃ punarapi tad rase kvāthe prakṣipet;
                                        anena vidhinā saptāhaṃ (saptavārān) tasya bhāvanā’ iti
                                        gaṅgādharaḥ; punastat prakṣipedrase

grahāḥ stotrāṇi mantrāṇi
                                        tathā‘tathā+anyāni havīṃṣi ca’ iti pā.;
                                    nānāhavīṃṣi ca

na nā svapiti rātriṣu
                                        nityastabdhena‘nistabdhena ca’ iti pā.;
                                    śephasā

balāyāḥ śūrpaparṇyośca jīvantyā jīvakasya
                                        ca‘ṛṣabhasya ca kākolīmadhukānāṃ rasena ca’ iti
                                        pā.;

pibenmātrāṃ rasālāyāstaṃ bhuktvā
                                        ṣaṣṭikaudanam‘tamadyādupariṣṭācca rasālāṃ mātrayā
                                        pibet’ iti pā.;

bhavataścātra- etaiḥ prayogairvidhivadvapuṣmān
                                        vīryopapanno‘snehopapannaḥ’ iti pā.;
                                    balavarṇayuktaḥ

div.p:
jātarūpasyeti suvarṇasya;
                                   maṇḍalarūpā+a+akṛtiriha suvarṇasya prabhāvādvṛṣyaprayogopakāriṇī
                                   bhavatīti vacanājjñeyam| tasyā eveti māṣaparṇabhṛtadhenvāḥ||11||

div.quote:
sarpiṣaḥ kuḍavaścaikastat sarvaṃ
                                        kṣīramarditam‘sarpiṣaḥ kuḍavaścaiva kṣīreṇa mṛditaṃ ca
                                        tat’ iti pā.;

div.p:
pāriśeṣyāt pumāñjātabalādika ucyate|
                                    pumāñjātabalādayaḥ śabdā asmin vidyanta iti pumāñjātabalādikaḥ;
                                    āsiktakṣīrikavacchabdasiddhiḥ||1-2||

div.quote:
yena nārīṣu sāmarthyaṃ
                                        vājīvallabhate‘vājīva labhate’ iti pā.;
                                    naraḥ

kṣayastamo jvaraḥ pāpmā
                                    mṛtyuścoktā‘mṛtyuścokto+ayamātmajaḥ’ iti pā.;
                                yamātmakāḥ

indriyāṇāṃ ca vaikṛtyaṃ
                                    jñeyaṃ‘dehasantāpalakṣaṇam’ iti pā.;
                                santāpalakṣaṇam

saṃśrito medaso mārgaṃ doṣaścāpi
                                    caturthakam‘gatirdvyekāntarā’ ityādikaṃ ‘doṣaścāpi
                                    caturthakam’ ityantaṃ pāṭhaṃ gaṅgādharo na paṭhati;

div.p:
nidāna ityādi| nidāne jvaranidāne, proktā “tatra
                               yathoktānāṃ liṅgānāṃ” (ni.a.1) ityādinā granthena prāguktetyarthaḥ;
                               punaḥ prakaraṇāgatatvāducyata iti na paunaruktyam| tayā coktaṃ
                               svalakṣaṇamiti tayā dvandvarūpayā dvandvalakṣaṇaṃ, tathā
                                   sannipātarūpayā‘sannipatitatayā’ iti pā.;
                               sannipātalakṣaṇamuktamityarthaḥ||110||-

div.quote:
vijvaratvaṃ laghutvaṃ ca
                                    kṣuccaivāsyopajāyate‘lāghavaṃ ca śarīrasya
                                    kṣuccaivāsyopajāyate’ iti pā.;

na sarpiḥ pāyayedvaidyaḥ
                                    kaṣāyaistamupācaret‘śamanaistamupācaret’ iti
                                pā.;

balaṃ hyalaṃ nigrahāya doṣāṇāṃ, balakṛcca
                                    tat‘balaṃ hyalaṃ doṣaharaṃ, paraṃ tacca balapradam’ iti
                                    pā.;

śākhānusārī raktasya‘tasyāśu muñcedbāhvoḥ
                                    kramāt sirām’ iti yogīndranāthasenasammataḥ pāṭhaḥ;
                                so+avasekāt praśāmyati

div.p:
autpādikaṃ‘autpattikaṃ’ iti pā.;
                               nicayagulmamabhidhāya prakṛtaśleṣmagulmalakṣaṇamāha-
                               staimityetyādi||15||

div.quote:
pramehiṇaḥ syuḥ, paritarpaṇāni‘paribṛṃhaṇāni’ iti
                                    pā.; kāryāṇi tasya‘tasmāt’ iti pā.;
                                prasamīkṣya vahnim

div.p:
mahāvāstviti mahāsthānam| matsyaśakalopamamiti
                               matsyatvaksadṛśam| kiṇavat kharaḥ sparśo yasya tat kiṇakharasparśam;
                               kiṇaḥ vraṇasthānam||21-26||

div.quote:
rudhirāgamārthamathavā
                                    śṛṅgālābūni‘śṛṅgālābūbhirāharedrudhiram’ iti pā.;
                                yojayet kuṣṭhe

sarpīṃṣi tiktakāni ca
                                    yaccānyadraktapittanut‘yaccoktaṃ’ iti pā.;
                                karma

kuṣṭhaṃ pāṭhā mustaṃ tumburumūrvāvacāḥ
                                    saṣaḍgranthāḥ‘kuṣṭhaṃ tumbaru pāṭhā mūrvā mustaṃ vacā+atha
                                    ṣaḍgranthā’ iti pā.;

tenāliptaṃ sidhmaṃ
                                    saptāhāhyeti‘saptāhāddharmasevino vyeti’ iti pā.;
                                tiṣṭhato gharme

kaphādbhedo‘kaphānmandaḥ’ iti pā.;
                                vibaddhaśca svaraḥ khurakhurāyate‘khunakhunāyate’ iti
                                    pā.;

paraṃ mukhasya vairasyanāśanaṃ rocanaṃ
                                    śṛṇu‘vakṣyāmyūrdhvaṃ rucikaraṃ mukhavairasyanāśanam’ iti
                                    pā.;

dvikārṣikāṇi‘palārdhakaṃ ca
                                    maricatvagelāpatrakeśarāt’ iti pā.;
                                patrailāhematvaṅmaricāni ca

sacitrakaṃ‘yavānikācitrakadhānyapāṭhāḥ
                                    sadīpyakatryūṣaṇavetasāmlāḥ’ iti pā.;
                                dhānyayavānyajājīsauvarcalaṃ tryūṣaṇavetasāmlam

upadravaṃ taṃ pravicārya
                                    tajjñastairbheṣajaiḥ‘svairbheṣajaiḥ’ iti pā.;
                                pūrvatarairyathoktaiḥ

visphoṭakāḥ sarvaśarīragāstu sphoṭāḥ‘sphoṭāḥ
                                    sadāhā jvaratarṣayuktāḥ’ iti pā.;
                                sarāgajvaratarṣayuktāḥ

śākaṃ gāḍhapurīṣāya prāgbhaktaṃ
                                    dāpayedbhiṣak‘trivṛtāśaṅkhinīdantīsudhāpūtīkapallavaiḥ;
                                    śākaṃ paktvā prayuñjīta prāgbhaktaṃ gāḍhavarcasi’ iti
                                    pā.;

pratiyogaiḥ‘pratīpograiḥ’ iti pā.;
                                praveśyāntraṃ preyaiḥ‘preyaiḥ sūcyagraiḥ; ‘ghreyaiḥ’ iti
                                    pā.; sīvyedvraṇaṃ tataḥ

pācanaṃ pāyayedvā
                                    tadyaduktaṃ‘yadvakṣyāmyatisāriṇe’ iti pā.;
                                hyātisārike

cikitsitamidaṃ siddhaṃ srāviṇāṃ śṛṇvataḥ
                                    param‘cikitsitamataḥ siddhaṃ srāviṇāṃ sampracakṣmahe’ iti
                                    pā.;

dehe prīṇāti gandhādīn
                                    ghrāṇādīnīndriyāṇi‘prāṇādīnindriyāṇi’ iti pā.;
                                ca

sthiratāṃ prāpya māṃsaṃ syāt svoṣmaṇā pakvameva
                                    tat“śoṇitaṃ svāgninā pakvaṃ vāyunā ca ghanīkṛtam; tadeva
                                    māṃsaṃ jānīyāt sthiraṃ bhavati dehinām;;” iti pā.;

doṣāṇāmapi caivaṃ
                                    syādekadeśaprakopaṇam‘syāttatra deśe prakopaṇam’ iti
                                    pā.;

karoti kupito mandamagniṃ sañchādya
                                    mārutaḥ‘mārutaḥ kupito vahniṃ sañchādya kurute gadān’ iti
                                    pā.;

grahaṇīṃ dīpayatyeva
                                    bṛṃhaṇaḥ‘bṛṃhaṇo+anilarogajit’ iti pā.;
                                kaphapittajit

kaphapāṇḍustu
                                    gomūtraklinnayuktāṃ‘gomūtrayuktāṃ klinnāṃ’ iti pā.;
                                harītakīm

sthānādutkāsamānaśca hṛdayaṃ manyate
                                    cyutam‘kāsamānaśca hṛdayaṃ sthānabhraṣṭaṃ sa manyate’ iti
                                    pā.;

pāṇipādatalaiḥ ślakṣṇaiḥ
                                    satatāsūyako‘ghṛṇāvānabhyasūyakaḥ’ iti pā.;
                                ghṛṇī

indrāṇiśākaṃ saghṛtaṃ
                                    śirīṣatvagbalāghṛtam‘deyaṃ vā dāhaśāntaye’ iti
                                pā.;

tṛṣṇā yā+a+amaprabhavā
                                    sā+apyāgneyā+a+amapittajanitatvāt‘sā+apyāgneyī na
                                    pittajanitatvāt’ iti pā.;

tasmānnoṣṇaklānto bhajeta sahasā jalaṃ
                                    śītam‘tasmādbhajeta sahasā noṣṇaḥ snāne jalaṃ śītam’ iti
                                    pā.;

jaṅgamaṃgaṅgādharastu ‘jaṅgamaṃ
                                    syādūrdhvabhāgamadhobhāgaṃ tu mūlajam’ iti paṭhati;
                                syādadhobhāgamūrdhvabhāgaṃ tu mūlajam

tasmāddaṃṣṭrāviṣaṃ‘tasmāddaṃṣṭriviṣaṃ’ iti
                                    pā.; maulaṃ hanti maulaṃ ca daṃṣṭrajam‘daṃṣṭrijam’
                                    iti pā.;

pittāśayasthitaṃ paittikasya
                                    kaphavātayorviṣaṃ‘kaphapittayo...’ iti pā.;
                                tadvat

hilimilisaṃspṛṣṭe rakṣa sarvabheṣajottame svāhā‘hili
                                    hili mili mili saṃsṛṣṭe rakṣa rakṣa sarvabheṣajottame svāhā’ iti
                                    pā.;

dṛṣṭvaivaṃ na tu sahasā bhojyaṃ
                                    kuryāttadannamagnau‘tadagramagnau tu’ iti pā.;
                                tu

pītā vāmottarā daṃṣṭrā
                                    raktaśyāvā+adharottarā‘raktaśyāve+adharottare’ iti,
                                    ‘raktaśyāve tathā+apare’ iti ca pā;

dāhatodasvedaśothakarī tu
                                    gṛhagodhikā‘vidāhaṃ śvayathuṃ todaṃ svedaṃ tu gṛhagodhikā’
                                    iti pā.;

api vāsukinā daṣṭaḥ
                                    pibenmadhughṛtāplutam‘dadhighṛtāplutam’ iti
                                pā.;

svarjikā+ajaśakṛtkṣāraḥ
                                    surasā+athākṣipīḍakaḥ‘akṣipīḍakaḥ pīḍayitvā yadraso+akṣṇi
                                    dīyate so+avapīḍo+akṣipīḍakaḥ’ iti gaṅgādharaḥ;

jaṭharaṃ grahaṇīdoṣo yakṣmā gulmaḥ kṣayo
                                    jvaraḥ‘jaṭharaṃ grahaṇīrogaṃ yakṣmāṇaṃ viṣamajvaram’ iti
                                    pā.;

div.p:
śirīṣatvagityādau āsphotā aparamallikā| surabhī
                               parṇāsabhedaḥ| bandhujīvaḥ putrajīvakaḥ| aśvakhurakaḥ syandanaḥ;
                               kiṃvā kokilākṣaḥ||242-249||

div.quote:
doṣaviṣyandanārthaṃ hi
                                    tasmai‘viṣyandanārthaṃ doṣasya tasya’ iti pā.;
                                madyaṃ viśeṣataḥ

rasaṃ sanāgaraṃ dadyāt
                                    tittiripratibhojanam‘taittiraiḥ pratibhojanam’ iti
                                    pā.;

candanānāṃ ca mukhyānāṃ śastāḥ
                                    pittamadātyaye‘saṃsparśāścandanārdrāṇāṃ strīṇāṃ
                                    pittamadātyaye’ iti pā.;

mātrākālaprayuktena karmaṇā+anena
                                    śāmyati‘karmaṇā+anena siddhena vikāra upaśāmyati’ iti
                                    pā.;

asthibhedāt saśalyatvāt
                                    saviṣatvācca‘saviṣatvādatarkaṇāt’ iti pā.;
                                sarpaṇāt

ālepanaṃ nirvapaṇaṃ
                                    tadvidyāttaiśca‘tadvidhānyaiśca’ iti pā.;
                                secanam

triphalā khadiro dārvī
                                    nyagrodhādirbalā‘nyagrodho+atibalā’ iti pā.;
                                kuśaḥ

vyoṣaṃ
                                    śvadaṃṣṭrātruṭisārasāsthi‘kṛmimārakāsthi’ iti pā.;
                                kolapramāṇaṃ madhumūtrayuktam

sarvāṇi rūpāṇi tu sannipātāt syuḥ pīnase
                                    tīvraruje+atiduḥkhe‘+atīva rujo+atiduḥkhe’ iti
                                pā.;

alpastu‘alpāśrurāgānupadehatāśca
                                    praspandatodātirujaśca vātāt’ iti pā.;
                                rāgo+anupadehavāṃśca satodabhedo+anilajākṣiroge

pākadāhāḍhyarūkṣeṣu‘pākadāhādyaruṣkeṣu’ iti
                                    pā.; śītā lepāḥ‘sekāḥ pralepanāḥ’ iti pā.;
                                sasecanāḥ

krimayaḥ karṇaśūlaṃ ca pūraṇādasya
                                    naśyati‘pūraṇādasya tailasya krimayaḥ karṇamāśritāḥ;
                                    kṣipraṃ praṇāśaṃ gacchanti kṛṣṇātreyasya śāsanāt;;
                                    kṣāratailamidaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ mukhadantāmayāpaham’ iti
                                pā.;

gairikaṃ saindhavaṃ mustaṃ rocanā
                                    ca‘rocanāmustalavaṇagairikaiśca’ iti pā.;
                                rasakriyā

bastamūtre tryahaṃ
                                    sthāpyamelācūrṇaṃ‘sthāpyaṃ biḍacūrṇaṃ’ iti pā.;
                                subhāvitam

svasthaḥ syādarditādīnāṃ
                                    muhurvege‘muhurvegāgame gate’ iti pā.;
                                gate+agate

sroto baddhvā+anilaṃ
                                    rundhyāttasmāttamanulomayet‘badhnāti taṃ ruddhvā’ iti
                                    pā.;

prāyaśaḥ sukumārāṇāṃ
                                    miṣṭānnasukhabhojinām‘miṣṭānnarasabhojinām’ iti,
                                    ‘mithyāhāravihāriṇām’ iti ca pā.;

siddhaṃ deyaṃ
                                    tridoṣe‘viṣonmādavātāsraśvāsakāsanut’ iti pā.;
                                syādvātāsre śvāsakāsanut

vātaghnaiḥ sādhitaḥ snigdhaḥ
                                    sakṣīramudgapāyasaḥ‘kṛsaro mudgapāyasaḥ’ iti
                                pā.;

kṣārastailaṃ‘kṣīraṃ tailaṃ’ iti pā.;
                                    gavāṃ‘ghṛtaṃ’ iti pā.; mūtraṃ jalaṃ ca kaṭukaiḥ
                                śṛtam

tayoḥ kriyā vidhātavyā
                                    bhedaśodhanaropaṇaiḥ‘vyadhaśodharopaṇaiḥ’ iti,
                                    ‘bhedaśodhanadāraṇaiḥ’ iti ca pā.;

sā rugārtā rajaḥ
                                    kṛcchreṇodāvṛttaṃ‘kṛcchreṇodāvṛttya’ iti pā.;
                                vimuñcati

abhayāmalakīyaṃ ca paitte śastaṃ
                                    rasāyanam‘brāhmamāmalakīyaṃ ca paitte śastaṃ virecanam’
                                    iti pā.;

daivavyapāśrayaṃ caiva bheṣajaṃ
                                    cābhicāraje‘daivavyapāśrayaṃ tatra bheṣajaṃ samprayojayet’
                                    iti pā.;

yasmādvivardhayatyāśu
                                    rasabhāvādvimānatā‘rasabhāvādvimārgataḥ’ iti, ‘raktapittaṃ
                                    samārutam’ iti ca pā.;

raktamārgeṇa sṛjati
                                    pratyanīkabalaṃ‘pratyanīkaguṇaṃ’ iti pā.;
                                kapham

vayobalaśarīrādibhedā hi bahavo matāḥ‘teṣāṃ
                                    tatsātmyayuktāśca vayovasthāyutāstathā; āyurbalaśarīrādibhedā hi
                                    bahavo matāḥ’ iti gaṅgādharasammataḥ pāṭhaḥ;

taṃ vistareṇa dravya-deha-doṣa-sātmyādīni
                                    ‘dravyadehadoṣasātmyādīn vasantādīṃśca’ iti pā.; 
                                pravibhajya vyākhyāsyāmaḥ

śvadaṃṣṭrakharakhaṅgānāṃ caivaṃ peyā śakṛdrase
                                    ‘pṛṣatarṣyakuraṅgāśvataragokarṇarāsame;
                                    hariṇājaśvadaṃṣṭrāvisambhave ca śakṛdrase’ iti pā.;

bimbyāḥ punarnavāyā vā kāsamardasya vā pṛthak
                                    ‘punarnavākāsamardabimbīhaimavatasya ca;
                                    mahāsahākṣudrasahāvṛścīrāṇāṃ pṛthak pṛthak’ iti pā.;

snigdhasvinno virecyastu peyāmātroṣitaḥ
                                    ‘peyāmātrocitaḥ’ iti, ‘peyāmātrāśritaḥ’ iti ca pā.; 
                                sukham

trivṛnmuṣṭīṃstu sanakhānaṣṭau droṇe+ambhasaḥ
                                    pacet ‘jale droṇe trivṛnmuṣṭīnaṣṭau tu sanakhān pacet’ iti
                                    pā.;

śaṅkhinī tiktalā caiva ‘tiktakā jñeyā’ iti,
                                    ‘tiktanālā ca’ iti ca pā.; 
                                yavatiktā+akṣi(kṣa)pīḍakaḥ

ekā suraikaḥ kampille tathā pañca ghṛte smṛtāḥ
                                    etacchlokacatuṣṭayaṃ hastalikhitapustake na paṭhyate;
                                )

prāpte tu varconilamūtravege
                                    vāte+ativṛddhe+alpabale ‘vāte viru(ba)ddhe’ iti pā.;
                                 gude vā

hanyāttathā mārutamūtrasaṅgaṃ
                                    bastestathā+a+aṭopamathāpi ‘…matīva ghoram’ iti pā.;
                                 ghoram

snigdhāmlalavaṇoṣṇaistaṃ
                                    rāsnāpītadrutailikaiḥ ‘rāsnāpītadrutilvakaiḥ’ iti pā.;
                                    ‘pītadruratra saralaḥ’ iti induḥ

snehasvedaistathotkleśya śodhyate śodhanairmalaḥ
                                    ‘kṣārotkliṣṭe yathā vastre malaḥ śudhdyati vāriṇā;
                                    snehasvedaistathotkliṣṭo doṣaḥ śuddhyati śodhanaiḥ’ iti pā.;

klamo dāho+aṅgasadanaṃ bhramo mūrcchā
                                    ‘dāho+aṅgamardaśca bhramo mūrcchā+arucistathā’ iti pā.; 
                                śirorujā

bastirdoṣāvṛto ruddhamārgo rundhyāt
                                    ‘bastirdoṣāvṛtastūrdhvamadho rundhyāt’ iti pā.; 
                                samīraṇam

śvasanaṃ kaphavātābhyāṃ ruddhaṃ tasya
                                    ‘śvasanaḥ kaphavātābhyāṃ ruddhastaṃ ca’ iti pā.; 
                                vimokṣayet

rūkṣātyadhyaśanāt ‘rūkṣāśanādadhyaśanāt
                                    prāgvātasya ca sevanāt’ iti pā.; 
                                pūrvavātāvaśyāyamaithunaiḥ

prasthastvajāvyorhi ‘ajāviṣu prasthamitaṃ
                                    nirūhaṇe kharādiṣu dvistriguṇaṃ gavāśvayoḥ; nirūha uṣṭrasya
                                    bhaveddvirāḍhako gajasya tu dvirhyanuvāsane+aṣṭamaḥ’ iti;
                                    ‘ajāviṣu prasthamuśanti tadvidaḥ’ iti ca pā.; 
                                nirūhamātrā gavādiṣu dvitriguṇaṃ yathābalam

ajīrṇādhyaśanajānāṃ niravaśeṣataśchardanaṃ rūkṣaḥ
                                    svedo ‘svedo dhūmapānaṃ’ iti pā.; 
                                laṅghanīyapācanīyadīpanīyauṣadhāvacāraṇaṃ ca (3)
